      <Docs>
        <summary>Indicates that data access is throttled to a slower speed when the limit is reached.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Indicates that data access is throttled to a slower speed when the limit is reached. After the user consumes their high-speed data allowance, the data connection remains active but is reduced to a lower bandwidth for the remainder of the billing cycle.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/SubscriptionPlan#LIMIT_BEHAVIOR_THROTTLED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.SubscriptionPlan.LIMIT_BEHAVIOR_THROTTLED</code>.</a></format></para>
